#: templates/config.html.twig:38
msgid ""
"The per-dashboard permission grants configured in this plugin control which "
"dashboards are displayed inside GLPI. They are a display filter only: the "
"actual security boundary in Grafana is the permission set of the dedicated "
"Grafana user configured below. Any GLPI user who can view at least one "
"dashboard will authenticate to Grafana as that shared user and could reach "
"any dashboard, folder, or data source that user has access to. Ensure the "
"configured Grafana user has access only to the dashboards intended for GLPI "
"users."
msgstr ""

